      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When documenting these events, focus on objective facts rather than your feelings to ensure your log is strong for any legal purposes. For each incident, record the date, time, what specifically happened (e.g., \"Payroll email delayed by 2 business days\"), who was involved, and any direct communication you received about it. Include copies of relevant emails or documentation, as concrete evidence is far more impactful than subjective descriptions.",
